      "Presented in 'superb' condition throughout and offered complete with its original books including the all important service warranty booklet, leather pouch, spare key, car cover, battery conditioner, tyre inflator kit, tools, warning triangle and dedicated history file.",
      "The car also benefits from the remainder of its extended Ferrari Power Warranty until 19th June 2027."
