      "Presented in excellent condition throughout, the car is complete with its original handbooks including guarantee and maintenance supplement, leather pouch, spare key, tool kit, warning triangle, tyre inflator kit, battery conditioner and car cover. A dedicated history file also accompanies the car, containing the original sales invoice and all previous service invoices from 2010 to the present day.",
      "A rare opportunity to acquire a truly stunning example, complete with its outstanding documented provenance."
